      <h2>About Aquaholics Kite &amp; Surf</h2>
      <p>Aquaholics Kite &amp; Surf in Paje is an IKO-certified kitesurfing and windsurfing center offering comprehensive lessons from first flight to advanced freestyle, foil boarding, and wing foiling — a complete progression pathway. Latest Core and Duotone kites, Fanatic and Starboard windsurf boards, foil boards, and rescue boat. Paje&#x27;s shallow lagoon provides ideal flat-water learning conditions with consistent cross-onshore winds. Multilingual IKO instructors, rescue boat, beachfront clubhouse with showers and lounge. Kitesurfing camps, progression packages, and equipment demo days.</p>

